🚀 Day 60/60: Build Your Portfolio & Release v1.0 



The final day of the Claude AI Coding Challenge was all about turning a working AI application into a production-ready, portfolio-quality project.

Claude AI reviews your live application and GitHub repository like a senior software engineer, fixes remaining issues, and helps you prepare everything needed for a professional launch—including an enhanced README, project documentation, portfolio description, resume bullet points, interview talking points, a future roadmap, and your GitHub v1.0.0 release.

Key Learnings

1. Building is only half the journey—documentation and presentation matter just as much.

2. A strong README and proper versioning reflect engineering maturity.

3. Production-ready software requires testing, maintainability, and great user experience.

4. AI is an incredible development partner from idea to deployment.

After 60 days, the result isn't just an AI app—it's a polished project ready to showcase your skills to the world.



